problem: Replace partial Hugo GitHub Pages docs repo with mdBook
approach: Removed Hugo theme/generated artifacts, converted docs scaffold into mdBook chapters, added Pages workflow, rebuilt history as a single main commit
failed_paths:
  - Prior Hugo scaffold with theme submodule and generated public output
verification:
  - mdbook build
  - git log --oneline --decorate --all -n 5
workflow_learning: For standalone Rust-adjacent docs sites, mdBook is a simpler fit than a themed SSG when markdown docs and Pages deploys are the goal
related_files:
  - book.toml
  - src/SUMMARY.md
  - .github/workflows/pages.yml
